## Limitations
lab_id / aggregated are 100% NA -> no lab clustering; 86 unique studies -> no study clustering. Originals are almost all
significant (79/86, max po 0.0727), so the absolute level of d is inflated by selection/publication bias — only
cross-domain contrasts are interpretable. project and discipline are collinear (Economics == ee), so "domain" and
"project protocol" cannot be separated. Relative metrics are unstable for small ro and change meaning under sign flips
(29% of Social pairs flip sign). No causal interpretation is supported.
